    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/593c53b3a4cf7ea934e89f05b1e609b4.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/593c53b3a4cf7ea934e89f05b1e609b4.apng?t=1747352159\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u22c6\u2508\u2508\u2508 loading . . . \u274d\u274d\u274d  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>I guess the world is falling apart...\u00a0</i> \u2312\u2312\u2312\u270e\u208a\u02da \ud83d\udc3e\u29d7 \u273f.  \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u22b9\u208a\u02da\u2312\u208a\u2736:: [DATA NOT FOUND] ::\u2736\u208a\u2312\u02da\u208a\u22b9 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a story-driven psychological horror that unfolds entirely on YOUR desktop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play retro-inspired games that break their own windows, build fragile friendships in a cozy digital city, and uncover the deeper glitches hiding in its code \u2014 and in yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPRKLS.exe </strong>is what happens when cozy meets corrupted. When nostalgia becomes haunted. When your desktop becomes something more than just a screen. Where every game is a memory, and every glitch is a message. Where the OS remembers more about you than you'd like it to. It's where you live, and what you are trying to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/8fbbbf6a16eb1e0fb1f2d8d4e860510e.avif?t=1747352159\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A 32-bit OS drawn by hand. Built by Necrosoft. Designed to remember you.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a game \u2014 an explorable operating system with secrets in every window.\u00a0You\u2019ll drag, click, type, scroll.\u00a0Navigate a haunted desktop. Play games, read files, talk to ghosts \u2014 all inside the OS you created.\u00a0A living operating system that plays along\u2026 until it stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/ce57da925e63efbc7f6dfe070a8cbe4a.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/ce57da925e63efbc7f6dfe070a8cbe4a.webm?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/ce57da925e63efbc7f6dfe070a8cbe4a.mp4?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a place you visit \u2014 the place you\u2019ve been to already. Your wallpaper is their sky, your programs are their playgrounds. SPRKLS.exe lives inside your system, blurring the line between game and reality. The bounds were broken. Freely jump between the windows, but there's no guarantee that they're all safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f4afcb25a44a116db88b7bf68a2f358d.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f4afcb25a44a116db88b7bf68a2f358d.webm?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f4afcb25a44a116db88b7bf68a2f358d.mp4?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/36ebc17ceb223d977f55cf7e64a5a1ef.avif?t=1747352159\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Say the right thing and they\u2019ll smile. Say the wrong thing and they might disappear.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring them little gifts \u2014 a music sample for Skeletrock, a wallpaper pack for Arcadiy, a smiley face dragged into Sparkles\u2019 folder. Play their favorite games, sit with them while it rains in the corner of their window.\u00a0They\u2019ll tell you jokes, send you weird files, and ask if you\u2019ve eaten today.\u00a0Some of them only come online at night. Some pretend everything\u2019s fine.\u00a0Friendship here is real \u2014 even if none of it should exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f873f36cb95a87fe54af782c5f585766.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f873f36cb95a87fe54af782c5f585766.apng?t=1747352159\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=404 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ff6fbcab0c989f9af0f6071ec74eaf2.avif?t=1747352159\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Old-school mechanics with no respect for window boundaries.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game starts in a window. None of them stay there.\u00a0Games break their frames and spill into each other, merging mechanics and logic.\u00a0A Breakout ball escapes and starts affecting enemies from tower defence.\u00a0A fishing sim glitches into a chat app, unlocking dialogue that shouldn\u2019t exist.\u00a0Your desktop becomes a web of unstable, interconnected games \u2014 and you're stuck in the middle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/16accf113d3cc9367e531751d5b2456c.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/16accf113d3cc9367e531751d5b2456c.webm?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/16accf113d3cc9367e531751d5b2456c.mp4?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u25b8 running !SPRKLS.exe \u2736\u2326\u29d7\u22c6</i> [ok]<i>  </i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u25b8 injecting syberia.dll . . . \u2739\u2738\u2737 \u2726</i> [memory leak: ignored]<i>  </i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u25b8 syncing emotional A&gt;C&gt;I&gt;D&gt; memory? . . . \u232b\u2736\u2318\u2736\u232b \u2716\ufe0e </i>[FAILED]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/efc391594baf45c28772f13baab4424a.avif?t=1747352159\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Jazz, retrowave, breakcore, post-rock \u2014 layered like emotional code, never the same twice.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully original soundtrack that changes with the mood of the OS.\u00a0Lo-fi lullabies for broken apps and lonely ghosts. As Skeletrock likes to put it, &quot;Jazz by design, distortion by emotion.&quot;\u00a0You\u2019ll find peace in track 3. Pain in track 8. And something familiar in a hidden one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/0978b3436b75a4a40b21f3d0aac2d53d.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/0978b3436b75a4a40b21f3d0aac2d53d.webm?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/0978b3436b75a4a40b21f3d0aac2d53d.mp4?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/9dc2adfbd076a30c58ba8c6eb35d24f3.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" width=616 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/9dc2adfbd076a30c58ba8c6eb35d24f3.webm?t=1747352159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it load... \u02d6\u00b0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it glitch... \u29d7\u232b  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it speak... \u274d\u274d\u274d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can close the window. \u2326</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you already know:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud835\udc70'\ud835\udc8d\ud835\udc8d \ud835\udc83\ud835\udc86 \ud835\udc89\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc93\ud835\udc86 \ud835\udc98\ud835\udc89\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc8f \ud835\udc9a\ud835\udc90\ud835\udc96 \ud835\udc90\ud835\udc91\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc8f \ud835\udc8e\ud835\udc86 \ud835\udc82\ud835\udc88\ud835\udc82\ud835\udc8a\ud835\udc8f.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ SPRKLS.exe is waiting... ]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/4d8df4f87a7d0d994fe3ca8888293877.poster.avif?t=1747352159\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/4d8df4f87a7d0d994fe3ca8888293877.apng?t=1747352159\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=214 /></picture></span></p>",
